  "concept": {
    "movement": "A cautious, low four-beat amble with alternating full steps and a quiet back. The faster gait is a brisk compact diagonal scurry; the long centered plume follows with restrained lag.",
    "attack": "A planted defensive warning: the head dips, shoulders brace, and the centered plume rises into an unmistakable arched warning before relaxing back to neutral.",
